= Using the avltree class =

The [../classes/html/classavltree.html avltree class] implements a self-balancing binary search tree using the AVL algorithm.  Since the avltree class is template-based, you can store arbitrary types of values.

AVL trees keep themselves balanced after each insertion or removal, so lookups are always efficient, even in the worst case.

The following example demonstrates how to insert values, get the count, access the top node, traverse the tree in-order, find values, remove values, and clear the tree.

